# Benchmark weight (local-only, never committed):
# - benchmarks/data/: downloaded datasets (BEAM parquets, oracle JSON, …)
# - benchmarks/supermemory/: vendored reference clone for static comparison
# - benchmarks/results/: scratch run outputs (committed evidence → reports/runs/)
# - benchmarks/memorybench/data + node_modules: harness deps and downloads
# Tracked: benchmarks/*.py harnesses + memorybench src/framework docs.
benchmarks/data/
benchmarks/supermemory/
benchmarks/results/
# memorybench is an embedded git repo with local secrets (.env.local);
# kept as a local-only harness, same as benchmarks/supermemory/.
